{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00182",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 3.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Excuse me, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.22,
      "end_seconds": 8.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.2,
      "end_seconds": 23.99,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "It's cramping pain in the lower tummy. I thought I'd wait, um, but it hasn't gone. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.21,
      "end_seconds": 30.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.0,
      "end_seconds": 33.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "It's been six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.19,
      "end_seconds": 38.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Right. How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.94,
      "end_seconds": 52.73,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I've been passing a lot of wind too, for nearly five years. I've, I've also had a feeling of not emptying fully, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.79,
      "end_seconds": 61.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Have you had cramping pain in the lower tummy before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.24,
      "end_seconds": 69.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Uh, you know, a bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.47,
      "end_seconds": 72.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "So, have you had any blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.54,
      "end_seconds": 77.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.72,
      "end_seconds": 86.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Have you had any fever, family history of bowel cancer, weight loss or night-time diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.0,
      "end_seconds": 96.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "No fever, family history of bowel cancer, weight loss or night-time diarrhoea, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.7,
      "end_seconds": 101.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.3,
      "end_seconds": 106.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.39,
      "end_seconds": 113.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.72,
      "end_seconds": 122.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Well, you know, I've had anxiety, yes. I've had heart disease, yes. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.9,
      "end_seconds": 125.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I see. What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.26,
      "end_seconds": 133.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "I, I had a bypass operation six years ago. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.63,
      "end_seconds": 137.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.45,
      "end_seconds": 141.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Oh, not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.43,
      "end_seconds": 145.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.76,
      "end_seconds": 158.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.7,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.64,
      "end_seconds": 162.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.63,
      "end_seconds": 169.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "I take clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day. Colospa. I take it when it cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.01,
      "end_seconds": 173.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.38,
      "end_seconds": 179.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.26,
      "end_seconds": 181.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.49,
      "end_seconds": 186.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.04,
      "end_seconds": 190.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.39,
      "end_seconds": 200.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.96,
      "end_seconds": 217.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 121 over 73, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temperature 36.6, pulse is 86 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.06,
      "end_seconds": 222.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.9,
      "end_seconds": 223.6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.32,
      "end_seconds": 236.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.03,
      "end_seconds": 241.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.14,
      "end_seconds": 245.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.37,
      "end_seconds": 257.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Soft tummy, a bit tender on the left lower side, no masses."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.69,
      "end_seconds": 258.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.06,
      "end_seconds": 278.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.98,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.74,
      "end_seconds": 295.21,
      "duration_seconds": 16.47,
      "text": "Well, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.6,
      "end_seconds": 317.1,
      "duration_seconds": 20.5,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is irritable bowel syndrome as a working diagnosis. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a food intolerance yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had cramping pain in the lower tummy for six months, mild, and no weight loss or night-time diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.6,
      "end_seconds": 319.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.06,
      "end_seconds": 328.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "I'm going to order a coeliac test, for bloating. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 331.69,
      "end_seconds": 335.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "We have a slot Tuesday at 3:30 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.12,
      "end_seconds": 353.84,
      "duration_seconds": 16.72,
      "text": "Note down what you ate before the bad days, it often reveals a pattern. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.69,
      "end_seconds": 358.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.28,
      "end_seconds": 365.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Alright, I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.04,
      "end_seconds": 370.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.31,
      "end_seconds": 378.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Alright, good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.86,
      "end_seconds": 383.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Hmm, that's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.91,
      "end_seconds": 386.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "So, bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}